name tikz-timing
category Package
revision 56291
shortdesc Easy generation of timing diagrams as TikZ pictures
longdesc This package provides macros and an environment to generate
longdesc timing diagrams (digital waveforms) without much effort. The
longdesc TikZ package is used to produce the graphics. The diagrams may
longdesc be inserted into text (paragraphs, \hbox, etc.) and into
longdesc tikzpictures. A tabular-like environment is provided to produce
longdesc larger timing diagrams.
depend svn-prov
